 ipmi-2027\nNotes: The 2027 site and the IPMI editions page confirm the 30
 th biennial IPMI\, June 27-July 2\, 2027\, at the Jouvence Center\, Lake 
 Stukely (Orford)\, Quebec. Paper abstracts are due December 7\, end of da
 y AoE. The site gives this as the submission deadline\, so it gates full 
 papers (December 14\, no extensions\, no hour\; provisional AoE). 12-page
  double-blind LNCS-format papers\; proceedings are traditionally LNCS. In
 -person attendance and one registration per paper are required. OpenRevie
 w opens in early November and had no IPMI group on 2026-10-31. Discussion
  period January 18-29. Attendance is capped at 120\; 51 papers in 2025. S
 ize is an editorial estimate.
